<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC PLUNGES AFTER WEDNESDAY'S SURGE.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC PLUNGES AFTER WEDNESDAY'S SURGE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brewer Zywiec SA plunged nine percent in a 1.8-million-zloty turnover to 136 zlotys in reaction to Wednesday's unexpected surge, analysts said.</p>
<p>&quot;These moves are purely accidental. It's impossible to find any fundamental reason of such extreme, conflicting moves,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Zywiec had risen 9.9 percent on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
